  "note": "Four songs come from the tape rather than the release. Road Trips 3:4 gives disc two to this night but omits Alabama Getaway, Greatest Story Ever Told, Far From Me and the Brokedown Palace encore; they take 4:26, 4:45, 5:08 and 6:18 from gd1980-05-06.157537.senn441.senn421.blend.eaton.miller.clugston.flac2496. No soundboard circulates for 5/6/80 at all — every transfer on archive.org is an audience recording — so that Rob Eaton master, mastered by Charlie Miller and Scott Clugston, is the best there is. Its remaining tracks differ from the release by between two and thirty-four seconds in both directions, which is ordinary tracking difference rather than the release excerpting anything, so the release keeps the other nineteen.",
